    "standardized_narrative": "Syndicate 609 reported an overall gross prior year reserve release of GBP 15.526 million for the 2021 financial year, calculated from the gross claims development triangle. This release occurred despite several adverse developments on specific prior year events. Reserves for COVID-19 increased by GBP 0.42 million gross, driven by legal costs in Non-Marine Property. The 2019 Golden Ray claim saw a further deterioration of GBP 2.28 million gross, impacting Marine, Energy Liability, Cargo, and Marine Reinsurance. Reserves for the 2019 Chile Riots were strengthened by GBP 1.93 million gross, affecting Non-Marine Property. Additionally, the 2012 MSC Flaminia claim experienced a noteworthy increase. The report also noted no material movement on Hurricane Laura (2020) claims. The overall release suggests larger unspecified favourable developments offset these strengthenings.",
